### Summary

**Root cause:** Every test follows the pattern *arrange → act → (no assert)*, inflating coverage to 95% while verifying almost nothing. This is the "test theater" anti-pattern — the suite protects against crashes but not against **wrong behavior**, which is exactly what your production bugs are.
